# CO-WP-CUSTOMER-001 — Lightweight Customer Workspace

Status: **COMPLETE (local)** · **NO DEPLOY** · Extends JOURNEY-003  
Docs: `docs/catalyst-connect/CATALYST-CONNECT-CUSTOMER-WORKSPACE.md`

## Principles

1. Customer identity from **Enterprise Customer Registry** (ECM Contact).  
2. Connect **renders** Partner Customer DTOs only — no local customer database.  
3. Sections: Profile · Contact · Active/Previous Opportunities · Documents · Notes · Tasks · Follow-up · Communication.  
4. Do **not** modify frozen Opportunity Creation / Opportunity Workspace without PO instruction.  
5. Do **not** deploy unless Product Owner authorises.

